.TH ferry-daemon 1  Ferry "Ferry Manual"
.SH NAME
ferry\-daemon \- Run in the background; trusted devices with Auto\-Accept are accepted automatically
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBferry daemon\fR [\fB\-d\fR|\fB\-\-downloads\-dir\fR] [\fB\-\-lang\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run in the background; trusted devices with Auto\-Accept are accepted automatically
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-d\fR, \fB\-\-downloads\-dir\fR \fI<DOWNLOADS_DIR>\fR
Folder for received files (default: the saved setting or the download folder)
.TP
\fB\-\-lang\fR \fI<CODE>\fR
Interface language for this run (`en`, `pl`); overrides the saved setting
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
